### =====================================================================
### product-read-service - ready-to-run requests (READ side of the catalog)
###
### Calls the service DIRECTLY on port 8105. Everything here is answered from
### Elasticsearch, which Debezium keeps in sync with product_db (MySQL).
### Vendor requests need X-Store-Id (normally added by the API gateway from the JWT).
###
### Seed data: store 1 = Fresh Mart, store 2 = Green Basket; product 17 (Mango) is INACTIVE.
### =====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8105


### 1. PUBLIC: categories for the home page (active ones, in display order)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories


### 2. PUBLIC: search "tomato" (best matches first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?q=tomato


### 3. PUBLIC: search by brand name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?q=amul


### 4. PUBLIC: search by category name ("dairy" matches the category "Dairy & Eggs")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?q=dairy


### 5. PUBLIC: Fresh Mart's fruits, cheapest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?storeId=1&categoryId=2&sort=PRICE_LOW_TO_HIGH


### 6. PUBLIC: everything between 20 and 50 rupees, most expensive first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?minPrice=20&maxPrice=50&sort=PRICE_HIGH_TO_LOW


### 7. PUBLIC: second page of 5 products, by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?sort=NAME&page=1&size=5


### 8. PUBLIC: one product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/1


### 9. PUBLIC: an INACTIVE product is not visible to customers -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/17


### 10. VENDOR (store 1): all my products, including INACTIVE ones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/products
X-User-Id: 3
X-User-Role: VENDOR
X-Store-Id: 1


### 11. VENDOR (store 1): only my hidden products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/products?status=INACTIVE
X-User-Id: 3
X-User-Role: VENDOR
X-Store-Id: 1


### 12. VENDOR: another store's product -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/products/11
X-User-Id: 3
X-User-Role: VENDOR
X-Store-Id: 1


### 13. ADMIN: all products of Green Basket (store 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products?storeId=2
X-User-Id: 2
X-User-Role: ADMIN


### 14. ADMIN: all categories, also inactive ones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories
X-User-Id: 2
X-User-Role: ADMIN


### 15. INTERNAL (service-to-service): any product in any status
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/products/17


### 16. Page size above 100 -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?size=500


### 17. PUBLIC: only products customers can buy right now (Pomegranate, product 13, is sold out)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?storeId=2&inStockOnly=true


### 18. VENDOR (store 1): my products that need restocking (stock from inventory-service)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/products?lowStockOnly=true
X-User-Id: 3
X-User-Role: VENDOR
X-Store-Id: 1
